{
  "_comment": "Event type profiles: ONE file read by web (src/lib/eventTypes.js) and iOS (bundled by apps/ios/project.yml, read by Lib/EventTypes.swift). Keys are events.cat_key values and the server's fixed ids (normalize_event_category, migration 087; preference interests, migration 162): never rename one. 'detailFields' must match validate_event_details (migration 202), checked by supabase/_localtest/28_event_details_assert.sql. A type without 'wizard' / 'detail' / 'card' / 'home' behaves exactly like the generic event.",
